WEBVTT

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.420
Stop killing them.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.120
It's all my fault.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.920
For resisting the Great Japanese Imperial Army,

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.280
this woman will die for your crimes.

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:33.400
No.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.200
She's the daughter of my savior.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.480
Please let her live.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.079
Help!

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:42.760
Help!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.360
She's just a child who knows nothing.

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:48.160
Kill me.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:50.960
No!

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.600
No, no.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:54.960
Bastard!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.240
Meixiang.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.770
I had a nightmare again.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:12.520
Come here.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.840
Did I say something strange just now?

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.340
You were speaking Japanese just now.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:33.020
We've been married for twenty years.

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:36.120
I don't even know who you are.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.450
You have to explain it clearly to me today.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:41.810
Who are you exactly?

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:44.440
Tell me!

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.400
My real name is Zhou Tiexiong.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.760
I was born in Fengtian, Northeast China.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.620
My parents died when I was little.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.360
I was just an orphan,

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:03.560
living by begging on the streets every day.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.800
I don't know if I had good luck or bad luck,

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.240
a Japanese veteran adopted me

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.450
and made me his adopted son.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.740
He provided me with food and clothes,

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.529
and taught me how to read and write.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.120
I once thought

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.920
that I had really gone to heaven.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:27.280
Until the day I came of age,

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.280
he said he wanted to hold a coming-of-age ceremony for me,

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.480
and sent me to the Japanese military camp as a soldier.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.440
From then on,

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.520
the nightmare began.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.640
The Japanese army trained us

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.240
by using civilians as bayonet targets.

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:51.040
Many people died in front of me with their intestines ripped out.

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:54.280
They also forced me

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:56.810
to undergo such courage-building training,

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.620
saying it was for the Emperor's holy war.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.040
I couldn't take it anymore,

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.360
so I had to play dead to leave the Japanese army

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.090
and flee all the way to the west,

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.040
wanting to get as far away from this battlefield as possible.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.440
Before I knew it,

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:14.920
I arrived at Sandaoyuan.

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.330
When I was about to starve to death,

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.320
Shangguan Bao appeared.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.560
He saved my life.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:24.480
And later,

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.040
later I met you.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.280
Since then,

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.200
I didn't want to run anymore.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.920
I wanted to stay

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:39.740
and spend the rest of my life with you.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.480
So,

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.680
the Japanese man who forced you,

00:05:50.159 --> 00:05:53.520
he came to the chief's birthday banquet?

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:54.840
That's him.

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.520
I have been hiding from him,

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.480
but I still fell into his hands.

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:05.050
I don't want to lose you.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.920
I can't lose you,

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.680
but I have absolutely no choice.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.760
Just tell me,

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.440
do you have the chief's blood on your hands?

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.080
No, absolutely not.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.440
I swear.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.800
I was deceived.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:30.120
I never thought of harming the chief.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.640
Meixiang, listen to me.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.880
I'll trust you one more time.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:52.460
I'll listen to you.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.320
I'll take Xiaoni away from here.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.800
But you can't keep making mistakes.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:03.320
You absolutely cannot make any more mistakes.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.560
Don't worry.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:08.620
Once I get rid of Tianyuan Zhengxiong's threat,

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.330
I will definitely correct my mistakes

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.080
and kill those lurking Japanese spies.

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:22.320
For the sake of you and our daughter,

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.500
I have to be a good man for once.

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.120
Master.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.200
Take a look at this first.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.640
Isn't this Cai Zhen?

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:58.159
It says Communist Party.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:00.960
Is there a mistake?

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.320
This was issued

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.880
from Major General Kurokawa's headquarters.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.680
The woman in the picture

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:11.000
is Cai Zhen, the Communist

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.280
who participated in the sabotage in Fuyang.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.480
I didn't expect Cai Zhen to be so complicated.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.080
She should be

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:29.160
a Communist hiding within the Nationalist army.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:35.440
The Communist Party and the Nationalist Party seem to be allies,

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:38.720
but they've been fighting openly and secretly.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:41.200
Major,

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.799
can we use this

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.000
to make a fuss?

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.480
You're very smart, Kiriyama.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:55.610
I've already had someone start working on it.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.880
I want to use Zhang Gongyan to get rid of Cai Zhen.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.480
Even if we can't get rid of her,

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:03.540
we can weaken the Communist Party's power in Shanzhou.

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:05.880
Brilliant, Major.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.240
Cai Zhen.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:21.720
Are my eyes playing tricks on me?

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.620
Is this really Major Cai Zhen on here?

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:25.480
Yes.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.400
It also says here

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.660
she is a Communist operating in Luoyang.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:35.320
This woman is actually a Communist.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.000
She hid so well,

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.260
actually infiltrating the Juntong.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:40.440
Commander Zhang.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.320
The Communists are best at two things:

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.320
espionage infiltration

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.380
and propaganda for the united front.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.370
We've been in Shanzhou for so long,

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.880
and nothing goes smoothly.

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:51.800
Actually,

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.930
it's the Communists causing trouble.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.000
If it weren't for Cai Baozi, who was in charge of communication,

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:57.880
getting into trouble,

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:01.000
those 100,000 swordsmen would have been theirs.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.080
Do you think this wanted poster

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.600
is enough to prove it?

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:07.480
Commander.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:08.720
Look,

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:11.800
the Japanese wouldn't for no reason

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.480
put out a wanted poster for a woman

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.080
and accuse her of being a Communist.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.280
Actually,

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.440
I've investigated this woman privately.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:22.760
She and a Communist named Cai Baozi

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.080
are very close.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.180
She has helped him time and again.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.240
I think she is one.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.720
It's this woman who ruined our plan,

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.560
snatching the fat piece of meat that was the Independent Brigade

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.960
right out of our mouths.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.320
Use your brain

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.480
and tell me everything you know.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.440
The Theater Commander

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.160
wants to drive the Communists out of Western Henan.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.840
This is a well-known fact.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:55.160
But the Communists have always been

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.840
careful and cautious.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.020
There isn't enough evidence.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.320
Commander Zhang.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.520
If you catch Cai Zhen

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.640
and use her as solid evidence,

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.960
wouldn't it be a great achievement?

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.180
If I catch Cai Zhen,

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:18.090
not only can I claim credit from my superiors,

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.660
but I can also take personal revenge. Right.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.320
Wonderful.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.210
Absolutely wonderful.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.200
Gather the troops

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:30.970
and arrest Cai Zhen.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:31.920
Yes.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.800
It feels so good to be back in my own seat.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.560
The matter I asked you to investigate,

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.760
how is it going?

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.240
All clues point to one person,

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:58.080
Zhang Gongyan.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.320
He is also the only one with the motive

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.080
to kill our father.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:15.320
Commander Zhang.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:19.280
I just got out of prison not long ago.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:21.920
I haven't had time to visit you yet.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.840
Why did you bring these people here

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:24.880
to make trouble?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.080
Brigade Commander Cui, you're pretty tough.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.480
What happened in the past was all a misunderstanding.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:32.000
Just calm down.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.200
Today we are here to arrest

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:35.800
the Communist spy Cai Zhen.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.160
What did you say?

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.000
Cai Zhen is a Communist?

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.560
Commander Zhang,

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.520
you can't make this kind of joke.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:09.500
She's from the Military Statistics Bureau.

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:12.280
Major Cai, nice disguise.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.040
Unfortunately, you were careless

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.900
and the Japanese found out first.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:19.440
Then what do you want, Commander Zhang?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.040
I want to invite you to be a guest in my prison.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.640
Then tell me

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:28.480
what conspiracy the Communists are planning.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.000
Take her away.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:32.560
Wait.

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:36.320
What,

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.580
Commander Cui?

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:40.290
Are you going to plead for a Communist?

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.360
Commander Zhang,

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.440
you know that I

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.640
have always hated Communists the most.

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.000
This woman

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.360
made me stay in jail for two days

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.640
and suffer a lot.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:53.960
I have to teach her a lesson.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.280
Leave her to me.

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:58.320
Okay.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.700
I'll give you a chance.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.920
Miss Cai, let's go.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:31.930
Comrade Wenpei.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.400
You two, get her out of the city quickly.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.320
Okay.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.360
What about you?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.400
How will you explain this to him?

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.360
Knock me out.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.600
Well, Comrade Wenpei,

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:46.640
how can I do that?

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:47.720
Yeah, right.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.840
I told you to knock me out.

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:50.840
Did you hear me?

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.520
Go. Hurry up and go.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:10.360
I thought using a tiger to drive away a wolf was brilliant enough,

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:12.690
but I didn't expect to see such a good show.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:14.600
I'll get rid of him.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:18.840
Brigade Commander, wake up.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:20.780
Give it to me. Come.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.800
Brigade Commander.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.160
With Zhang Gongyan around,

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.400
Cui Wenkui is like a tiger in a cage.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.440
No matter how capable he is, he can't use it,

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:35.970
so he is not worth our worry.

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.120
The ones we need to eliminate

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.250
are the most troublesome Communists.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.840
Through this forest,

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.900
We'll be at our liaison station soon.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.300
Someone is tailing us.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.450
Don't look back.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.580
Are they Zhang Gongyan's men?

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:08.890
I can't see clearly.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.320
They're all in plain clothes.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.720
I can't tell who they are.

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:13.850
They can't be Zhang Gongyan's men.

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:15.160
On Chinese soil,

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.000
who else would sneak around like this

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.840
but Japanese spies?

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:21.800
Out of the frying pan

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:23.600
and into the fire.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:27.040
It seems the reason for all the trouble in Shanzhou

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.000
is Tianyuan Zhengxiong's doing.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.260
Go find Baozi quickly.

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:32.090
Our place is no longer safe.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:32.760
Okay.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:42.960
Wenpei, why are you back?

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.040
We need to evacuate immediately.

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.080
It's no longer safe here.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:45.880
What's wrong?

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.200
Japanese spies are nearby.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:47.840
We must leave now.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:48.920
Bring all the documents.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:49.560
Okay.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:55.460
Hurry, there's no time. Let's go.

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.200
Let's go, Wenpei. Let's go.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.130
Hurry, let's go.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:05.480
Hurry!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.170
Baozi, take out the document quickly.

00:17:10.599 --> 00:17:11.920
You guys take the document and leave.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.960
Baozi and I will distract the enemy

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:15.319
to cover your retreat.

00:17:15.319 --> 00:17:16.079
This document contains

00:17:16.079 --> 00:17:17.520
the list of our organization's activities

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:18.800
and future operation plans.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:19.720
You must protect it well.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.839
Never let it fall into anyone else's hands.

00:17:20.839 --> 00:17:22.119
Don't worry, you guys be careful.

00:17:22.119 --> 00:17:23.440
Stay safe. Go now.

00:17:23.839 --> 00:17:24.640
Take care.

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:26.079
- Go.
- Go.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.640
Welcome to Qinfoyegou.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.320
Boss.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:26.600
These two are my distinguished guests.

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:27.930
Show them some respect.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.860
Let me tell you.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.280
Stepping into my territory

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.720
is like entering a maze.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.800
Not to mention the Japanese,

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.600
even the locals

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.400
would get lost here.

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.160
Boss Huo,

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.320
thanks to your help today.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.320
Otherwise, we...

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.520
Otherwise,

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.240
you really would have become ghosts under the Japanese swords.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.240
What the hell are you talking about?

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:53.800
No matter how fierce the Japanese are,

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:55.360
didn't you still come back alive?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.290
Second Brother.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.160
I didn't expect to be so lucky either.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:00.240
Just thinking about the Japanese makes me angry.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.800
My wound still hurts.

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:04.360
But then again, Second Brother,

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:05.220
when I ran back,

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:06.760
didn't I scare you too?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.120
You really are a lucky guy.

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.920
Miss Cai, you really have no idea.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:12.960
Recently,

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.760
my second brother has been tracking the Japanese.

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:17.320
We didn't expect to save you halfway.

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:18.280
Tell me,

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:19.400
what is this?

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:21.320
Destiny, right?

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.000
Destiny.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:24.920
Boss Huo,

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.400
you saved us today.

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:28.880
I am extremely grateful.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.680
Don't mention it.

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:34.320
But aren't you afraid that the Qinglong Stronghold people

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.840
will come to make trouble for you,

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:37.900
saying you are harboring a murderer?

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:39.720
Harboring what murderer?

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:40.800
Let me tell you.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.120
The people in Qinfoyegou

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.680
are all extremely wicked.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:48.400
We don't care about one more murderer.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.480
Let me tell you guys,

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.600
don't underestimate me.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:56.200
Although I, Huo Lang, don't have piercing eyes,

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.400
I am not blind either.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.440
After the Big Boss died,

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.560
everyone said Cai Baozi

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:05.080
was the murderer.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.440
Even my eldest niece took a shot at him.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.560
But as for me, I don't believe it.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.440
Why?

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:16.600
I've been through life and death with Cai Baozi.

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:17.600
What kind of person he is,

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.400
I know best.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.730
Saying he covets the Big Boss's position,

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.440
nonsense.

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:27.600
Boss Huo,

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.880
I have a new understanding of you today.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:31.480
Okay.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:33.160
Stop being polite.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.020
I haven't finished speaking yet.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.040
The boss is dead.

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:38.960
We must avenge him.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.400
We need to find out who the killer is.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.540
I already sent someone

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.290
to sneak into Qinglong Stronghold secretly.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.680
The messenger said

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.080
that He Xiaobian,

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:52.840
since he took over the boss's position,

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:54.400
has been acting weird,

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:57.210
sneaking down the mountain several times

00:20:57.760 --> 00:20:58.800
to meet someone.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.200
He Xiaobian.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:05.010
Who did he go to meet?

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.840
They were too far away.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.360
The person following him couldn't see clearly.

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:10.280
Boss Huo,

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.520
do you suspect

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.440
that Shangguan Bao's death is related to He Xiaobian?

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:16.800
I'm not confused, am I?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:17.840
All right, all right.

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:18.960
Let's go inside and talk.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.200
We need to discuss what to do next.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:21.920
Let's go.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:25.320
Xiaoliu,

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:26.600
hurry up and make some tea.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.280
Didn't you see we have distinguished guests?

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:29.760
You have no tact at all.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:30.400
This...

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:32.480
Meixiang.

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:36.080
Keep this for the journey.

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.280
We have enough travel expenses.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:45.160
You will need this.

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:46.640
Keep it for yourself.

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:56.800
Uncle, it's about time.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:58.800
Yinger.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:04.160
I leave Aunt Meixiang and Xiaoni in your care.

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:06.280
Don't worry.

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:07.360
I've got this.

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:09.210
I'm counting on you.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:12.960
Dad.

00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:25.280
Let's go.

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:27.160
Let's go, Nier.

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:29.320
Let's go.

00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:34.080
Get on.

00:22:34.840 --> 00:22:35.680
Careful.

00:22:36.360 --> 00:22:37.200
You go first.

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:40.520
Aunt.

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:41.960
Advisor.

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:49.840
Old man.

00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:54.980
Look after the house well.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:57.050
Wait for us to come back.

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:05.400
Go.

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:45.760
Stop this carriage.

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:47.020
Catch the people in it.

00:23:47.120 --> 00:23:47.880
Go.

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:52.520
Catch this carriage.

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:01.880
Bastard.

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:15.680
Meixiang, Ni'er.

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:20.650
I hope you have made it out of the mountain safely.

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:24.040
Speed up to catch up with them.

00:24:24.040 --> 00:24:24.960
And get ahead of them.

00:24:24.960 --> 00:24:25.520
Yes.

00:24:25.600 --> 00:24:26.200
Go.

00:24:30.440 --> 00:24:33.720
I can't use the men from Qinglong Stronghold.

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:36.920
Now I can only rely on Huo Lang's power

00:24:37.960 --> 00:24:39.890
to get rid of Tianyuan Zhengxiong.

00:24:51.320 --> 00:24:52.200
Wait a minute.

00:24:56.800 --> 00:24:58.840
Auntie, the city gate is just ahead.

00:24:59.080 --> 00:25:00.160
Once you enter the city,

00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:01.690
you and Xiaoni will be safe.

00:25:02.600 --> 00:25:04.280
What are you doing, Ying?

00:25:06.560 --> 00:25:08.040
I can't go with you.

00:25:08.040 --> 00:25:09.770
I must return to Qinglong Fort.

00:25:11.440 --> 00:25:12.720
What are you doing?

00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:14.440
Didn't you agree with your uncle

00:25:14.440 --> 00:25:15.280
to come with us?

00:25:15.280 --> 00:25:16.740
Qinglong Fort is not safe.

00:25:18.240 --> 00:25:19.760
If Uncle didn't say that,

00:25:20.320 --> 00:25:23.040
would you have been willing to leave the mountain?

00:25:23.040 --> 00:25:24.320
With the enemy approaching,

00:25:24.320 --> 00:25:26.000
I have to stay with my brothers.

00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:26.840
Sister,

00:25:27.200 --> 00:25:28.280
didn't you say

00:25:28.440 --> 00:25:30.040
you'd protect me?

00:25:32.680 --> 00:25:33.680
Silly girl.

00:25:35.080 --> 00:25:36.680
I'll come find you guys soon.

00:25:37.840 --> 00:25:38.840
Remember,

00:25:40.360 --> 00:25:42.020
take good care of your mother.

00:25:42.960 --> 00:25:43.720
Ying.

00:25:45.720 --> 00:25:46.520
Miss Cai.

00:25:47.760 --> 00:25:49.280
Here's a leopard skin rug for you.

00:25:49.280 --> 00:25:50.360
It's very warm.

00:25:51.440 --> 00:25:53.400
Chief Huo, I don't need this.

00:25:53.760 --> 00:25:55.520
No, this cave is too damp.

00:25:55.520 --> 00:25:56.840
With your delicate skin,

00:25:56.840 --> 00:25:58.440
it wouldn't be good if you caught a cold.

00:25:58.440 --> 00:26:00.080
Is the murderer of the chief

00:26:00.280 --> 00:26:01.840
really He Xiaobian?

00:26:02.320 --> 00:26:04.400
Everything is in chaos right now.

00:26:04.680 --> 00:26:06.520
What should we do next?

00:26:09.440 --> 00:26:10.320
Miss Cai.

00:26:11.200 --> 00:26:12.320
I am a person

00:26:12.320 --> 00:26:13.960
who can't hide anything.

00:26:16.480 --> 00:26:18.560
I really like you.

00:26:23.120 --> 00:26:24.800
I hope you can stay here,

00:26:24.800 --> 00:26:26.080
eat well, sleep well,

00:26:26.480 --> 00:26:27.480
and stay for good.

00:26:28.240 --> 00:26:29.000
To be honest,

00:26:29.240 --> 00:26:31.240
if we were about the same age,

00:26:31.600 --> 00:26:32.800
I would definitely beg you

00:26:32.800 --> 00:26:35.280
to be my wife.

00:26:35.800 --> 00:26:38.000
I appreciate your kindness, Chief Huo.

00:26:38.440 --> 00:26:39.680
You really don't need to. Just accept it.

00:26:39.680 --> 00:26:40.610
Second Brother.

00:26:40.800 --> 00:26:41.760
Let's drink.

00:26:41.760 --> 00:26:42.420
No, this...

00:26:42.480 --> 00:26:44.160
Miss Cai, no, just take it.

00:26:44.680 --> 00:26:45.640
Drink.

00:26:46.000 --> 00:26:47.440
What drink?

00:26:47.680 --> 00:26:49.240
I'm talking here.

00:26:54.200 --> 00:26:55.000
Baozi.

00:26:57.080 --> 00:26:59.000
I know you are upset now

00:26:59.920 --> 00:27:01.180
and anxious to get out.

00:27:04.040 --> 00:27:07.570
Seeing that the united front mission was about to be completed,

00:27:07.960 --> 00:27:10.220
I never expected it to turn out like this.

00:27:10.760 --> 00:27:12.760
We still underestimated the enemy.

00:27:13.600 --> 00:27:15.640
But this is the most urgent moment.

00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:17.120
We can't panic.

00:27:21.760 --> 00:27:23.280
What should we do next?

00:27:23.600 --> 00:27:26.360
We must find out the real killer of Shangguan Bao.

00:27:26.360 --> 00:27:28.840
Otherwise, all our previous work will be in vain.

00:27:28.840 --> 00:27:30.000
Without the trust of the swordsmen,

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:31.930
what's the point of a united front?

00:27:33.040 --> 00:27:34.000
Chief.

00:27:34.600 --> 00:27:35.400
What's wrong?

00:27:38.520 --> 00:27:39.480
Chief,

00:27:39.800 --> 00:27:42.120
someone sent a message by throwing a knife.

00:27:42.120 --> 00:27:42.920
Bring it here.

00:27:44.520 --> 00:27:45.400
Miss Cai, this...

00:27:45.400 --> 00:27:46.200
Just right.

00:27:46.320 --> 00:27:47.240
Take a look.

00:27:54.600 --> 00:27:55.860
No, what does this say?

00:27:56.440 --> 00:27:57.680
Masao Tahara.

00:27:59.080 --> 00:28:02.000
Yidaoyuan Underground Courtyard, oil shop.

00:28:02.720 --> 00:28:04.520
This is great.

00:28:05.360 --> 00:28:07.220
We finally caught the fox's tail.

00:28:07.640 --> 00:28:09.920
Boss Huo, you did a good job.

00:28:10.360 --> 00:28:11.480
No, what's good about it?

00:28:11.480 --> 00:28:12.560
I didn't do it.

00:28:13.080 --> 00:28:14.080
You didn't do it?

00:28:14.760 --> 00:28:15.690
Second Brother.

00:28:15.800 --> 00:28:18.000
Wasn't this note written by one of our men?

00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:18.760
No, this...

00:28:18.960 --> 00:28:20.280
No, look at this knife.

00:28:20.480 --> 00:28:21.940
Is it from our stronghold?

00:28:26.560 --> 00:28:28.720
Could it be that Masao Tahara

00:28:29.760 --> 00:28:31.400
has set a trap

00:28:31.840 --> 00:28:33.570
to lure us out of the mountains?

00:28:33.600 --> 00:28:34.880
Didn't you say Qin Foye Gully

00:28:34.880 --> 00:28:36.520
is hard for others to find?

00:28:36.600 --> 00:28:37.280
Right.

00:28:38.280 --> 00:28:41.160
Except for the people from our Eighteen Poles Mountain,

00:28:41.160 --> 00:28:42.220
who could sneak in?

00:28:42.720 --> 00:28:43.520
This...

00:28:46.120 --> 00:28:47.880
Don't worry. As long as you're here,

00:28:47.880 --> 00:28:49.810
no one can touch a hair on your head.

00:28:54.040 --> 00:28:57.440
To be honest, staying here makes me uncomfortable all over.

00:28:57.720 --> 00:29:00.320
How about we call the brothers out

00:29:00.680 --> 00:29:01.920
to stretch our legs?

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:05.120
Boss Huo, just give the word.

00:29:06.040 --> 00:29:06.880
Alright.

00:29:08.560 --> 00:29:09.320
Wang Shi'er.

00:29:10.600 --> 00:29:11.720
I'm thinking,

00:29:11.720 --> 00:29:14.760
as long as Masao Tahara is not eliminated,

00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:17.600
our Sandaoyuan won't have peace.

00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:20.040
Whether it's true or false this time,

00:29:20.480 --> 00:29:23.080
since we know his hiding place,

00:29:23.600 --> 00:29:26.520
let's pick a few capable brothers and make a trip.

00:29:26.800 --> 00:29:27.440
What do you think?

00:29:27.440 --> 00:29:29.240
Second Brother, I've been waiting for you to say that.

00:29:29.240 --> 00:29:30.160
I'll go right now. All right.

00:29:30.160 --> 00:29:31.090
Go immediately.

00:29:36.280 --> 00:29:37.560
If it's true,

00:29:37.840 --> 00:29:41.200
I will tear him into pieces this time.

00:29:59.840 --> 00:30:02.200
Takeshita, how is it?

00:30:03.280 --> 00:30:04.240
Tahara,

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:07.530
after my repeated examination and scrutiny,

00:30:07.960 --> 00:30:09.800
this is just an ordinary map.

00:30:10.280 --> 00:30:12.120
There is nothing valuable on it.

00:30:15.600 --> 00:30:16.600
Takeshita,

00:30:17.160 --> 00:30:19.160
you are an expert in this field.

00:30:19.600 --> 00:30:22.000
I went through a lot of trouble to get these two maps.

00:30:22.000 --> 00:30:23.860
You must observe them carefully.

00:30:23.960 --> 00:30:25.890
Make sure you don't miss anything.

00:30:39.920 --> 00:30:42.250
Tahara Masao sure knows how to pick a spot.

00:30:42.320 --> 00:30:43.240
Hiding here.

00:30:43.920 --> 00:30:44.850
Second Brother.

00:30:45.280 --> 00:30:46.200
Second Brother.

00:30:46.200 --> 00:30:47.800
I'm familiar with this place.

00:30:47.800 --> 00:30:48.600
You are?

00:30:48.800 --> 00:30:49.680
My aunt

00:30:49.880 --> 00:30:51.740
is from Zhang Village right here.

00:30:51.800 --> 00:30:53.280
How many villages

00:30:53.600 --> 00:30:54.680
and houses are here,

00:30:54.680 --> 00:30:55.800
I know them all.

00:30:57.560 --> 00:30:59.080
We've been walking all this way,

00:30:59.080 --> 00:31:00.810
and I haven't seen any villages

00:31:01.000 --> 00:31:02.280
or houses or anything like that.

00:31:02.280 --> 00:31:03.040
Miss Cai,

00:31:03.240 --> 00:31:04.640
on this plateau,

00:31:05.080 --> 00:31:06.920
the villages are all underground.

00:31:06.920 --> 00:31:09.650
The villagers live in subterranean courtyards.

00:31:10.560 --> 00:31:11.240
Wenpei.

00:31:11.880 --> 00:31:13.960
Seeing trees but no village, seeing a village but no houses,

00:31:13.960 --> 00:31:15.200
hearing voices but seeing no people,

00:31:15.200 --> 00:31:16.760
that describes subterranean courtyards.

00:31:16.760 --> 00:31:18.080
Yes, yes, that's right.

00:31:18.080 --> 00:31:18.880
Brothers,

00:31:18.880 --> 00:31:20.480
hide the horses well in a bit.

00:31:20.480 --> 00:31:21.410
Second Brother.

00:31:21.920 --> 00:31:22.920
I'll lead the way.

00:31:23.440 --> 00:31:24.440
How about I lead?

00:31:24.680 --> 00:31:26.480
I'll lead. I'll lead. I'll lead.

00:31:35.240 --> 00:31:36.160
Major,

00:31:36.560 --> 00:31:38.220
Huo Lang brought his men here.

00:31:44.680 --> 00:31:45.440
Don't panic.

00:31:45.600 --> 00:31:47.040
Pack your things and come with me.

00:31:47.040 --> 00:31:47.640
Yes, sir.

00:32:04.200 --> 00:32:05.400
It should be this way.

00:32:06.960 --> 00:32:07.600
Probably.

00:32:07.800 --> 00:32:10.130
I remember it's this way, Second Brother.

00:32:13.320 --> 00:32:14.120
Right here.

00:32:15.600 --> 00:32:16.360
Look.

00:32:16.560 --> 00:32:17.760
I told you it was here.

00:32:17.800 --> 00:32:19.060
Attention, everyone.

00:32:19.080 --> 00:32:21.000
This is the entrance to the Dikeng Courtyard.

00:32:21.000 --> 00:32:22.440
Once we go in,

00:32:22.440 --> 00:32:23.570
you must stay close.

00:32:23.800 --> 00:32:25.000
It's very big inside.

00:32:25.400 --> 00:32:26.840
If you're not careful,

00:32:26.840 --> 00:32:27.920
you'll get lost.

00:32:28.360 --> 00:32:29.620
Do I need you to tell me?

00:32:31.680 --> 00:32:32.680
Let me tell you.

00:32:32.880 --> 00:32:35.000
I made a promise to Miss Cai.

00:32:35.240 --> 00:32:37.240
We will capture Masao Tahara alive.

00:32:37.520 --> 00:32:38.800
If you embarrass me,

00:32:39.000 --> 00:32:40.200
I'll kill you.

00:32:40.600 --> 00:32:42.480
Don't worry, Second Brother.

00:32:42.800 --> 00:32:44.530
I'll find someone to ask later.

00:32:47.880 --> 00:32:49.320
Fellow villager, let me ask you something.

00:32:49.320 --> 00:32:51.000
Don't run! Catch him!

00:32:51.560 --> 00:32:53.800
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

00:32:56.080 --> 00:32:57.210
Why are you running?

00:32:58.400 --> 00:33:00.060
I saw you all carrying knives.

00:33:00.280 --> 00:33:02.080
You're either robbers or the security corps.

00:33:02.080 --> 00:33:04.160
If I didn't run, I'd just be waiting for you to rob me.

00:33:04.160 --> 00:33:05.120
This...

00:33:05.120 --> 00:33:06.040
You kid.

00:33:06.360 --> 00:33:07.360
Let me tell you,

00:33:07.640 --> 00:33:08.800
you've misunderstood.

00:33:08.800 --> 00:33:09.920
We are good people.

00:33:10.280 --> 00:33:11.240
Look.

00:33:11.440 --> 00:33:13.080
We are the famous

00:33:13.080 --> 00:33:14.520
Qinfoyegou Swordsmen.

00:33:15.760 --> 00:33:16.600
What?

00:33:17.200 --> 00:33:19.330
You are the bandits from the mountain?

00:33:19.480 --> 00:33:20.480
No.

00:33:20.480 --> 00:33:21.920
What nonsense are you talking about? Enough.

00:33:21.920 --> 00:33:23.440
Are you asking for a beating?

00:33:23.440 --> 00:33:25.040
Enough. What are you doing?

00:33:28.080 --> 00:33:30.120
Look how big the reputation of your Qinfoyegou is.

00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:32.380
You frightened the civilians like this.

00:33:32.800 --> 00:33:34.160
Yes, Miss Cai.

00:33:34.360 --> 00:33:36.000
We, the people of Qinfoyegou,

00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:37.480
just have bad tempers.

00:33:37.480 --> 00:33:39.400
We have never done anything wicked.

00:33:39.400 --> 00:33:40.920
Yes, Miss Cai.

00:33:41.520 --> 00:33:43.050
I was a bit anxious just now.

00:33:43.320 --> 00:33:45.850
I was just trying to catch the Japanese spies.

00:33:46.360 --> 00:33:47.880
I didn't know my limits.

00:33:47.880 --> 00:33:50.000
How about this.

00:33:50.360 --> 00:33:51.600
I'll ask again.

00:33:51.600 --> 00:33:52.800
Speak nicely and ask again.

00:33:52.800 --> 00:33:54.240
I'll be nicer. Well...

00:33:55.000 --> 00:33:55.880
Sir.

00:33:56.800 --> 00:33:58.600
Do you know where the oil shop is?

00:33:59.800 --> 00:34:00.720
Oil shop?

00:34:02.360 --> 00:34:03.640
What oil shop?

00:34:04.040 --> 00:34:05.600
We need to go to the oil shop for some business.

00:34:05.600 --> 00:34:06.960
If you know the way,

00:34:06.960 --> 00:34:09.290
could you point us in the right direction?

00:34:11.400 --> 00:34:12.600
Go through that hole,

00:34:13.120 --> 00:34:14.360
pass through these two alleys,

00:34:14.360 --> 00:34:15.679
and there's a big tree inside.

00:34:15.679 --> 00:34:16.810
It's right under it.

00:34:17.960 --> 00:34:18.760
Thank you.

00:34:20.159 --> 00:34:21.000
Look at you.

00:34:21.280 --> 00:34:22.840
You can't even ask for directions.

00:34:22.840 --> 00:34:24.679
Miss Cai had to do it herself.

00:34:24.920 --> 00:34:28.320
You've completely disgraced Qin Foyegou.

00:34:28.520 --> 00:34:29.449
Second Brother.

00:34:29.480 --> 00:34:30.440
When I catch the Japanese spies later,

00:34:30.440 --> 00:34:32.120
I'll win back our face, okay?

00:34:32.600 --> 00:34:33.639
You take the lead.

00:34:35.239 --> 00:34:37.920
You guys block this entrance.

00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:39.960
Don't let Tianyuan Zhengxiong escape.

00:34:39.960 --> 00:34:40.820
Did you hear me?

00:34:40.840 --> 00:34:41.719
Yes.

00:34:41.840 --> 00:34:42.520
Let's go.

00:35:16.400 --> 00:35:17.320
Wenpei,

00:35:17.880 --> 00:35:19.880
don't you think something is wrong?

00:35:21.840 --> 00:35:23.300
We rushed all the way here,

00:35:23.320 --> 00:35:25.840
but didn't see any visible or hidden sentries.

00:35:25.840 --> 00:35:28.280
This doesn't look like a Jap hideout.

00:35:28.800 --> 00:35:30.040
I think so too.

00:35:30.440 --> 00:35:31.640
I actually feel

00:35:32.040 --> 00:35:34.970
there's something wrong with that middle-aged man.

00:35:36.520 --> 00:35:37.760
I didn't notice it.

00:35:38.040 --> 00:35:40.640
He just looked like an ordinary villager here.

00:35:41.160 --> 00:35:43.020
My instinct has never been wrong.

00:35:44.720 --> 00:35:46.480
But what is the problem?

00:35:47.240 --> 00:35:48.960
Keep your voices down.

00:35:49.280 --> 00:35:51.160
We might alert the Japs.

00:35:52.120 --> 00:35:55.280
I think that guy Tian is hiding here.

00:35:58.840 --> 00:35:59.760
Brothers,

00:36:00.280 --> 00:36:01.360
follow me later.

00:36:01.520 --> 00:36:02.980
Let's split up and search.

00:36:03.080 --> 00:36:05.800
We must capture that guy Tian alive.

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:06.600
Go.

00:36:16.200 --> 00:36:16.760
Go.

00:36:29.640 --> 00:36:30.200
Is anyone here?

00:36:30.200 --> 00:36:31.240
Nobody.

00:36:31.360 --> 00:36:32.640
Oh no, Second Brother.

00:36:33.560 --> 00:36:35.440
We've searched several pit yards.

00:36:35.440 --> 00:36:36.800
Did we make a mistake?

00:36:49.520 --> 00:36:51.200
I was wondering what was wrong.

00:36:51.200 --> 00:36:52.040
When we mentioned

00:36:52.040 --> 00:36:53.600
catching Japanese spies just now,

00:36:53.600 --> 00:36:55.200
that middle-aged man wasn't scared at all.

00:36:55.200 --> 00:36:57.160
He is definitely not an ordinary villager.

00:36:57.160 --> 00:36:59.280
I was just trying to catch Japanese spies.

00:36:59.280 --> 00:37:00.610
I didn't handle it well.

00:37:01.360 --> 00:37:02.720
He is the Japanese spy.

00:37:05.200 --> 00:37:07.400
Our brothers are in danger. Let's go back quickly.

00:37:07.400 --> 00:37:08.480
Hurry! No, this...

00:37:08.880 --> 00:37:09.600
Go.

00:37:19.360 --> 00:37:21.280
If I catch this Japanese spy,

00:37:21.480 --> 00:37:23.340
I will definitely burn him alive.

00:37:24.280 --> 00:37:25.960
Tahara Masao must have received the news

00:37:25.960 --> 00:37:27.080
and ran away with his men.

00:37:27.080 --> 00:37:28.320
You shouldn't have stopped me just now.

00:37:28.320 --> 00:37:29.880
I would have beaten that Japanese devil to death.

00:37:29.880 --> 00:37:30.960
All right, stop talking.

00:37:30.960 --> 00:37:32.680
Hurry up and chase them. Everyone, charge.

00:37:32.680 --> 00:37:33.520
Go, chase them.

00:37:33.520 --> 00:37:34.680
Chief Huo, don't be reckless.

00:37:34.680 --> 00:37:36.480
Tahara Masao is not that simple.

00:37:36.640 --> 00:37:37.920
Let's hurry up and follow them,

00:37:37.920 --> 00:37:39.780
in case they have an accident. Go.

00:37:49.600 --> 00:37:50.260
Over there.

00:37:51.760 --> 00:37:54.160
Major, the person who was pursuing us just now

00:37:54.160 --> 00:37:55.680
looked like Cai Baozi.

00:37:55.880 --> 00:37:57.210
That's right, it's him.

00:37:57.400 --> 00:37:59.400
Didn't he fall off the cliff and die?

00:37:59.400 --> 00:38:01.040
It seems he is really lucky.

00:38:01.600 --> 00:38:03.640
Major, we only have a few men left.

00:38:03.640 --> 00:38:04.680
Where can we go?

00:38:09.360 --> 00:38:11.560
We can't stay in Shanzhou City anymore.

00:38:11.920 --> 00:38:12.880
But,

00:38:13.120 --> 00:38:14.520
as long as we have the map,

00:38:14.680 --> 00:38:16.940
we still have a chance to turn the tables.

00:38:17.640 --> 00:38:19.100
Follow me to find someone.

00:38:19.200 --> 00:38:20.000
Who?

00:38:38.040 --> 00:38:38.960
Boss.

00:38:40.440 --> 00:38:42.720
A friend of yours is outside asking to see you.

00:38:42.720 --> 00:38:44.320
Since when do I have friends?

00:38:45.120 --> 00:38:47.080
All my friends are in the stronghold.

00:38:47.080 --> 00:38:48.610
He says his surname is Tian.

00:38:48.800 --> 00:38:49.680
He's Boss Tian from Shanzhou City,

00:38:49.680 --> 00:38:51.410
who sells oil, salt, and cloth.

00:38:51.880 --> 00:38:53.140
Tianyuan Zhengxiong.

00:38:53.680 --> 00:38:55.440
Didn't Huo Lang kill him?

00:38:55.960 --> 00:38:57.800
How many people? How are they dressed?

00:38:57.800 --> 00:38:59.440
Six people, one carriage,

00:38:59.760 --> 00:39:01.360
and they are carrying goods.

00:39:04.200 --> 00:39:05.460
Right, I remember now.

00:39:06.640 --> 00:39:07.880
I asked them to come.

00:39:09.440 --> 00:39:11.680
Let's go. I'll go take a look with you.

00:39:11.760 --> 00:39:12.520
Let's go.

00:39:31.440 --> 00:39:32.280
Boss He,

00:39:33.040 --> 00:39:33.840
that's him.

00:39:34.720 --> 00:39:36.640
Boss Tian, long time no see.

00:39:36.840 --> 00:39:37.840
How have you been?

00:39:38.520 --> 00:39:41.000
Thanks to you, Boss He, I've been doing well.

00:39:42.680 --> 00:39:44.120
Your Qinglong Stronghold

00:39:44.120 --> 00:39:46.720
is truly guarded like an iron fortress.

00:39:46.880 --> 00:39:49.240
I came to visit you, yet you had to come in person.

00:39:49.240 --> 00:39:50.840
I'm really sorry about that.

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:53.900
How dare you come here?

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:55.160
Do you have a death wish?

00:39:55.160 --> 00:39:56.320
It's exactly because I want to live

00:39:56.320 --> 00:39:57.480
that I came here.

00:39:57.720 --> 00:40:00.320
With your protection, I'll be perfectly fine.

00:40:01.200 --> 00:40:02.760
Aren't you afraid I'll tie you up?

00:40:02.760 --> 00:40:03.520
Go ahead.

00:40:03.960 --> 00:40:06.020
Tying me up is like tying yourself up.

00:40:07.280 --> 00:40:10.080
Masao Tahara, this is Qinglong Stronghold,

00:40:10.280 --> 00:40:12.080
not the Japanese army's territory.

00:40:12.080 --> 00:40:13.080
Chief He.

00:40:13.280 --> 00:40:14.440
I know.

00:40:16.800 --> 00:40:18.280
It's just a matter of time.

00:40:18.520 --> 00:40:20.440
Don't tell me Chief He

00:40:20.440 --> 00:40:22.770
doesn't even have this little foresight.

00:40:28.880 --> 00:40:30.280
Mr. Tian, please.

00:40:30.680 --> 00:40:31.680
Thank you.

00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:35.160
Bring in all Chief He's gifts.

00:40:35.480 --> 00:40:36.800
Yes. Let's go.

00:41:00.560 --> 00:41:01.520
He,

00:41:02.080 --> 00:41:03.880
how dare you deceive me?

00:41:04.280 --> 00:41:05.540
Tianyuan Zhengxiong,

00:41:06.640 --> 00:41:08.280
what makes you say that?

00:41:08.600 --> 00:41:10.260
The experts have examined it,

00:41:10.640 --> 00:41:13.680
and that map is clearly just an ordinary painting.

00:41:14.880 --> 00:41:17.080
But you kept saying it was a treasure map.

00:41:17.080 --> 00:41:18.410
How do you explain this?

00:41:18.640 --> 00:41:19.760
This is Shangguan Bao's

00:41:19.760 --> 00:41:22.960
gold mine treasure map that he kept hidden in the secret room.

00:41:22.960 --> 00:41:24.640
As for you not being able to decipher it,

00:41:24.640 --> 00:41:25.920
that's your problem.

00:41:26.400 --> 00:41:27.920
Instead of shouting here,

00:41:27.920 --> 00:41:30.280
why don't you go back and let your experts take another look?

00:41:30.280 --> 00:41:31.360
The experts said

00:41:31.360 --> 00:41:33.160
it's just an ordinary painting.

00:41:34.600 --> 00:41:36.860
Do you think I still dare to lie to you now?

00:41:37.160 --> 00:41:38.160
Not necessarily.

00:41:39.200 --> 00:41:40.720
Let me tell you, He,

00:41:41.160 --> 00:41:43.360
don't think that just because you gave me the map,

00:41:43.360 --> 00:41:44.720
you're safe and sound.

00:41:45.680 --> 00:41:47.140
Then what else do you want?

00:41:47.880 --> 00:41:50.040
If that map can't be deciphered,

00:41:51.040 --> 00:41:52.500
you won't have a good time.

00:41:53.000 --> 00:41:54.720
You still dare to threaten me?

00:41:56.880 --> 00:41:58.360
I am already all alone.

00:41:58.360 --> 00:42:00.020
I'm not afraid of you anymore.

00:42:00.560 --> 00:42:01.840
All alone?

00:42:02.760 --> 00:42:03.640
Really?

00:42:05.600 --> 00:42:06.480
Chibei-kun.

00:42:11.880 --> 00:42:12.600
Ni'er.

00:42:17.520 --> 00:42:18.200
You...